{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24572","headline":"春日闲居三首 二 · 白居易","name":"春日闲居三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"广池春水平，羣鱼恣游泳。\n新林绿阴成，衆鸟欣相鸣。\n时我亦潇洒，适无累与病。\n鱼鸟人则殊，同归於遂性。\n缅思山梁雉，时哉感孔圣。\n圣人不得所，慨然叹时命。\n我今对鳞羽，取乐成谣咏。\n得所仍得时，吾生一何幸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24572.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24572","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}